        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You own no soul-weapon at all. You reach into the air, take the spirit particles that are already there, and make a bow out of them.</p><p><strong>Granted skill</strong> Crafting. <strong>Release ladder</strong> Schrift &rarr; Vollst&auml;ndig.</p><p>Your demon arts are <strong>Gint&#333;</strong> &mdash; silver tubes of liquefied reiryoku, uncorked and spoken over. You know <strong>Heizen</strong> and <strong>Gritz</strong>, and you cannot learn others. At 5th level you gain the talent that started a war: you do not out-fight a Soul Reaper, you <strong>switch them off</strong>.</p>"
